    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Scantlings of category A ships shall be approved by the Administration, or a recognized organization accepted by it, taking into account standards acceptable to the Organization or other standards offering an equivalent level of safety; scantlings of category B ships shall be approved by the Administration, or a recognized organization accepted by it, taking...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
