    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for equivalentStressCycles derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Equivalent stress cycles</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0240</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The calculated blade stresses must satisfy sigma_ref2/sigma_st &gt;= 1.3 (6.39). If finite element analysis is used for estimating the stresses, von Mises stresses shall be used. sigma_ref2 is the reference strength, defined as the lower of 0.7*sigma_u and 0.6*sigma_0.2 + 0.4*sigma_u. The fatigue design of the propeller blade is based on an estimated load distr...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <nltl:module rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#moduleCore"/>
    <nltl:namingBasis>Locked-workbook normalized regulatory term</nltl:namingBasis>
