    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Hydrodynamic bollard thrust</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0336</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The maximum forward and backward ice thrusts are T_f = 1.1*F_f [kN] (6.17) and T_b = 1.1*F_b [kN] (6.18). The design thrust along the propeller shaft line must be calculated using the formulae below. The greater value of the forward and backward direction loads shall be taken as the design load for both directions. Factors 2.2 and 1.5 take account of the dyn...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <nltl:module rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#moduleMachinery"/>
