    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Blade stresses shall be calculated for the design loads in section 6.5.1. Finite element analysis shall be used for final approval of all propellers. The simplified root-area estimate is sigma_st = C_1*M_BL/(100*c*t^2) [MPa] (6.38).</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
