    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0777</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The type of the SN-curve shall be selected to correspond with the material properties of the blade. If the SN-curve is unknown, the two slope SN curve shall be used.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
