    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0086</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Load cases 1-4 must be covered, as given in Table 6-4 below, for CP and FP propellers. To obtain blade ice loads for a reversing propeller, load case 5 must also be covered for FP propellers.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
