    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0394</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The Manual shall include risk-based procedures for the following: voyage planning to avoid ice and/or temperatures that exceed the ship's design capabilities or limitations; arrangements for receiving forecasts of the environmental conditions; means of addressing any limitations of the hydrographic, meteorological and navigational information available; oper...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
