    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>If there is first blade order torsional resonance in the operational speed range or in the range 20% above and 20% below the maximum operating speed (bollard condition), the design torque (Qpeak) of the shaft component shall be determined by means of torsional vibration</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
