    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0250</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Exposed escape routes shall remain accessible and safe, taking into consideration the potential icing of structures and snow accumulation.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
