    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Design vertical wave shear force</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0198</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The applied vertical shear stress, taua, is to be determined along the hull girder in a similar manner as in UR S11.5.4.2 by substituting the design vertical ice shear force for the design vertical wave shear force.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <nltl:module rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#moduleHull"/>
    <nltl:namingBasis>Benchmark-coined descriptive engineering term</nltl:namingBasis>
