    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Cutout</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0180</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The loads carried by a member in way of cut-outs are not to cause instability. Where necessary, the structure is to be stiffened.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
