    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Ships intended to provide icebreaking escort shall be equipped with a sound signaling system mounted to face astern to indicate escort and emergency manoeuvres to following ships as described in the International Code of Signals.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
