    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Forward blade force</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0280</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Fb is the maximum force experienced during the lifetime of a ship that bends a propeller blade backwards when the propeller mills an ice block while rotating ahead. Ff is the maximum force experienced during the lifetime of a ship that bends a propeller blade forwards when the propeller mills an ice block while rotating ahead. Fb and Ff originate from differ...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
