    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0067</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>If a ship is intended to operate astern in ice regions, the aft section of the ship is to be designed using the Bow and Bow Intermediate hull area requirements.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <nltl:module rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#moduleHull"/>
