  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#iceLoadCycleCount">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ice load cycle count</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#benchmarkEntity"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:altLabel>Nice</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>iceLoadCycleCount</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for iceLoadCycleCount derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Ice load cycle count</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0362</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>where k is the shape parameter of the spectrum, Nice is the number of load cycles in the spectrum, and Fice is the random variable for ice loads on the blade, 0 &lt;= Fice &lt;= (Fice)max. The shape parameter k=0.75 shall be used for the ice force distribution of an open propeller and the shape parameter k=1.0 for that of a ducted propeller blade.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
