    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0717</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>When required, personal and group survival equipment sufficient for 110% of the persons on board shall be stowed in easily accessible locations, as close as practical to the muster or embarkation stations.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
