    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0020</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Ships operating in areas and during periods where ice accretion is likely to occur shall be: designed to minimize the accretion of ice; and equipped with such means for removing ice as the Administration may require; for example, electrical and pneumatic devices, and/or special tools such as axes or wooden clubs for removing ice from bulwarks, rails and erec...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
