    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0593</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The following load cases are intended to reflect the operational loads on the propulsion system, when the propeller interacts with ice, and the respective reaction of the complete system. The ice impact and system response causes loads in the individual shaft line components. The ice torque Qmax may be taken as a constant value in the complete speed range. W...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
