    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Portable and semi-portable extinguishers shall be located in positions protected from freezing temperatures, as far as practical. Locations subject to freezing are to be provided with extinguishers capable of operation at the PST.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
