    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0667</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The strength of the propulsion line shall be designed according to the pyramid strength principle. This means that the loss of the propeller blade shall not cause any significant damage to other propeller shaft line components.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
