  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#bladeReferenceStrength1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Blade reference strength1</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#benchmarkEntity"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue"/>
    <skos:altLabel>sigma_ref1</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for bladeReferenceStrength1 derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Blade reference strength1</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0093</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>...lastic bending around the blade root shall be calculated using F_ex = 300*c*t^2*sigma_ref1/(0.8*D - 2*r) [kN] (6.35), or by an appropriate stress analysis reflecting the non-linear plastic material behaviour of the actual blade. The load is assumed to act at radius 0.8R in the weakest blade direction. A blade is regarded as failed if the tip offset exceeds 1...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
