    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for propellerShaftDesignThrust derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Propeller shaft design thrust</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0600</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The maximum forward and backward ice thrusts are T_f = 1.1*F_f [kN] (6.17) and T_b = 1.1*F_b [kN] (6.18). The design thrust along the propeller shaft line must be calculated using the formulae below. The greater value of the forward and backward direction loads shall be taken as the design load for both directions. Factors 2.2 and 1.5 take account of the dyn...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <nltl:module rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#moduleMachinery"/>
    <nltl:namingBasis>Unit-stripped normalized regulatory variable</nltl:namingBasis>
    <nltl:namingRule>N3 - remove unit from the identifier and retain it in unit/quantity metadata</nltl:namingRule>
    <nltl:quantityKindLabel>Force</nltl:quantityKindLabel>
    <nltl:recommendedUnit rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloN"/>
    <nltl:roleDecisionBasis>Quantity metadata requires the canonical QUDT QuantityValue node pattern</nltl:roleDecisionBasis>
    <nltl:sourceAlias>designThrust_kN</nltl:sourceAlias>
    <nltl:sourceAlias>design_thrust_T_r_kN</nltl:sourceAlias>
    <nltl:sourceReference>TRF-081 | TRAFICOM p.37 | 6.5.2.1-6.5.2.2</nltl:sourceReference>
    <nltl:sourceRequirementId>TRF-081</nltl:sourceRequirementId>
    <nltl:stage1LocalName>propellerShaftDesignThrust</nltl:stage1LocalName>
    <nltl:unitDecisionStatus>Verified recommended QUDT unit from Stage 1 or a documented Stage 2 source-unit refinement</nltl:unitDecisionStatus>
    <nltl:unitSymbol>kN</nltl:unitSymbol>
  </rdf:Description>
