    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0058</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>In order to establish procedures or operational limitations, an assessment of the ship and its equipment shall be carried out, taking into consideration the following: the anticipated range of operating and environmental conditions, such as operation in low air temperature, operation in ice, operation in high latitude, and potential for abandonment onto ice ...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
