    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Bulbous bow present</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0113</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>(vii) For ships which are assigned the Polar Class PC6 or PC7, and equipped with bulbous bows, the design ice forces on the bow are to be determined according to I2.3.2.1 (iv). In addition, the design forces are not to be taken less than those given in I2.3.2.1 (iii), assuming fa = 0.6 and AR = 1.3.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <nltl:module rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#moduleHull"/>
