    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0133</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The number of load cycles per propeller blade in the load spectrum shall be N_ice = k_1*k_2*k_3*N_class*n_n (6.14), where N_class is given in Table 6-6 and the propeller location factor k_1 is given in Table 6-7.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
