    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0782</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The vertical extension of the ice strengthening of framing shall be at least as given in Table 4- 6. Where an upper bow ice belt is required (see 4.3.1), the ice-strengthened part of the framing shall be extended to at least the top of this ice belt. Where the ice-strengthening would go beyond a deck, the top or bottom plating of a tank or tank top by no mor...</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
