    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0585</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>In order to avoid very high loads on propeller blade tips, the minimum distance between the propeller(s) and the hull (including stern frame) should be no less than h0 (see 4.2.1).</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
