    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>For components that are subject to loads resulting from propeller/ice interaction with all the propeller blades, the number of load cycles (Nice) must be multiplied by the number of propeller blades (Z).</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <nltl:module rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#moduleMachinery"/>
