    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0363</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>If the supported stringer is outside the ice belt, the force F shall be multiplied by (1- hs/ls), where hs and ls shall be as defined in section 4.5.2.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
