    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>sigma_exp is the mean fatigue strength of the blade material at 10^8 cycles to failure in seawater. [TRAFICOM, p.50, 6.6.2.3 and repeated p.51, 6.6.2.4]</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
