    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for hydraulicRudderReliefValvePresent derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Hydraulic rudder relief valve present</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0335</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Relief valves for the hydraulic pressure in rudder turning mechanism(s) shall be installed. The components of the steering gear (e.g. rudder stock, rudder coupling, rudder horn etc.) shall be dimensioned to withstand loads causing yield stresses within the required diameter of the rudder stock.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
