    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for hullGirderPosition derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Hull girder position</skos:prefLabel>
    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0333</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>The design vertical ice shear force, FI, along the hull girder is to be taken as: FI = Cf * FIB [MN] where Cf = longitudinal distribution factor to be taken as follows: (a) Positive shear force Cf = 0.0 between the aft end of LUI and 0.6LUI from aft Cf = 1.0 between 0.9 LUI from aft and the forward end of LUI</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
    <nltl:module rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#moduleHull"/>
    <nltl:namingBasis>Benchmark-coined descriptive engineering term</nltl:namingBasis>
