    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Watertight and weathertight doors, hatches and closing devices which are not within an habitable environment and require access while at sea shall be designed to be operated by personnel wearing heavy winter clothing including thick mittens.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
