    <nltl:draftConceptId>VOC-0410</nltl:draftConceptId>
    <nltl:evidenceExcerpt>Bergy waters mean an area of freely navigable water in which ice of land origin is present in concentrations less than 1/10. There may be sea ice present, although the total concentration of all ice shall not exceed 1/10.</nltl:evidenceExcerpt>
